  - id: letter_to_ephesus
    displayName: The Lost First Love
    flavorText: Christ commends Ephesus for its labor and discernment, yet rebukes
      the church for abandoning its first love.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Commends the church's labor, patience, and rejection of false apostles
      and the deeds of the Nicolaitans, but rebukes it for abandoning its first love
      and calls it to repent and return to its earlier works, on pain of having its
      candlestick removed.
    deliveredByManagerId: jesus_revelation
    managerId: letter_to_ephesus
