  - id: letter_to_smyrna
    displayName: The Crown of Life
    flavorText: Christ comforts persecuted Smyrna, promising a crown of life to those
      faithful unto death.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Addressed to a church suffering real poverty and tribulation, with no
      rebuke at all - only encouragement to remain faithful even unto death against
      coming imprisonment, in exchange for the crown of life and exemption from 'the
      second death.'
    deliveredByManagerId: jesus_revelation
    managerId: letter_to_smyrna
