  - id: letter_to_philadelphia
    displayName: The Open Door
    flavorText: Christ sets before faithful Philadelphia an open door no man can
      shut, promising to keep her from the hour of temptation coming upon the whole
      world.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Like Smyrna, receives no rebuke - commended for keeping Christ's word
      and not denying his name despite little strength, promised an 'open door' no
      man can shut and preservation 'from the hour of temptation, which shall come
      upon all the world.'
    deliveredByManagerId: jesus_revelation
    managerId: letter_to_philadelphia
