  - id: throne_room_and_lamb
    displayName: The Sealed Scroll
    flavorText: John beholds the heavenly throne room where a Lamb as it had been
      slain alone is found worthy to take the sealed scroll and open it.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Shows the heavenly throne room itself - God enthroned, the four living
      creatures, the twenty-four elders, and a scroll sealed with seven seals that
      no one is found worthy to open until the slain-yet-standing Lamb takes it,
      establishing the vision's central image of worship before the action of the
      seals begins.
    deliveredByManagerId: john_the_revelator
