  - id: the_seven_seals
    displayName: The Four Horsemen
    flavorText: The Lamb opens the seven seals in turn, unleashing the four horsemen
      of conquest, war, famine, and death upon the earth.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: The Lamb opens six of the seven seals in sequence, releasing the four
      horsemen (conquest, war, famine, death), the cry of martyred souls under the
      altar, and cosmic upheaval, building dread toward the seventh seal, which opens
      instead into silence and the trumpets to come.
    deliveredByManagerId: john_the_revelator
