  - id: the_144000_and_multitude
    displayName: The Palms of the Multitude
    flavorText: An angel seals 144,000 servants of God from the twelve tribes, and
      John sees a great multitude of every nation clothed in white who came out of
      great tribulation.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: An interlude before the seventh seal's silence, sealing 144,000 servants
      of God - 12,000 from each of twelve tribes - followed by a vision of an uncountable
      multitude from every nation clothed in white with palms, who 'came out of great
      tribulation.'
    deliveredByManagerId: john_the_revelator
