    purpose: Seven angels sound seven trumpets in sequence, each unleashing an escalating
      plague on the earth, sea, rivers, and sky through demonic locusts and a vast
      army, building toward the seventh trumpet's declaration that 'the kingdoms
      of this world are become the kingdoms of our Lord.'
