    flavorText: A woman clothed with the sun gives birth to a son while a great red
      dragon waits to devour him, and the child is caught up to God's throne.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: A great sign-vision of a woman clothed with the sun, about to give birth,
      opposed by a great red dragon waiting to devour her child; when the child (who
