  - id: everlasting_gospel_and_harvest
    displayName: The Sharp Sickle
    flavorText: Angels proclaim the everlasting gospel and Babylon's coming fall,
      then one like the Son of man reaps the earth's harvest with a sharp sickle.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: An interlude of three angelic proclamations - the everlasting gospel,
      the fall of Babylon foretold, and a warning against worshipping the beast or
      receiving his mark - followed by two harvest visions (grain and grapes) symbolizing
      final ingathering and judgment.
