  - id: the_seven_bowls_of_wrath
    displayName: The Vials of Wrath
    flavorText: Seven angels pour out seven bowls of God's wrath upon the earth in
      rapid succession, culminating in a catastrophic earthquake.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Seven angels pour out seven bowls ('vials' in the KJV) of God's wrath
      in rapid succession - sores, the sea and rivers turned to blood, scorching
      heat, darkness, the drying of the Euphrates to prepare the way for kings, and
      a final catastrophic earthquake - the most concentrated judgment sequence in
      the book, ending with the declaration 'It is done.'
    deliveredByManagerId: john_the_revelator
    managerId: the_seven_bowls_of_wrath
