  - id: babylon_the_great
    displayName: Mystery, Babylon the Great
    flavorText: John sees the great whore, Mystery Babylon the Great, drunk with
      the blood of the saints, before her sudden and total fall.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: A vision of 'the great whore' - a woman named Mystery, Babylon the Great,
      arrayed in purple and scarlet and drunk with the blood of the saints, riding
      a scarlet beast - followed by her sudden fall and a lament from the kings,
      merchants, and shipmasters who profited from her, mourning the city's loss
      'in one hour.'
    deliveredByManagerId: john_the_revelator
