  - id: marriage_supper_and_rider
    displayName: The Marriage Supper of the Lamb
    flavorText: Heaven rejoices at Babylon's fall and announces the marriage of the
      Lamb, as the rider called Faithful and True goes forth to defeat the beast
      and false prophet.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Heaven rejoices over Babylon's fall and announces 'the marriage of the
      Lamb,' with the Church figured as his bride 'arrayed in fine linen, clean and
      white'; the vision then turns to the triumphant rider on a white horse who
      defeats the beast, the false prophet, and the kings of the earth gathered against
      him.
