  - id: thousand_years_and_great_white_throne
    displayName: The Great White Throne
    flavorText: Satan is bound a thousand years and finally cast into the lake of
      fire, and the dead of every age are judged before the great white throne.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Satan is bound for a thousand years while the martyred faithful reign
      with Christ; released briefly to deceive the nations one final time before
      being finally defeated and cast into the lake of fire, the vision closes with
      the dead of all the ages judged before the great white throne 'according to
      their works,' out of the books, and out of the book of life.
    deliveredByManagerId: john_the_revelator
